<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Quilmes upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Quilmes upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Quilmes Industrial SA to buy from outperform, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 10-7/8 on Thursday in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
